  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nIn content/browser/indexed_db/indexed_db_database.cc, leveldb::Status IndexedDBDatabase::OpenCursorOperation creates a cursor and passes ownership of it to an instance of IndexedDBCallbacks, which itself takes ::indexed_db::mojom::CallbacksAssociatedPtrInfo callbacks_inf"
